## Architecture & Systems

```
                              ┌────────────────────────┐
                              │        Main.hx         │
                              │  (Boot & State Machine) │
                              └───────────┬────────────┘
                                          │
            ┌─────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────┐
            ▼                             ▼                            ▼
  ┌───────────────────┐         ┌───────────────────┐        ┌───────────────────┐
  │   IntroSequence   │         │    Physics & 3D   │        │     UI & Audio    │
  ├───────────────────┤         ├───────────────────┤        ├───────────────────┤
  │ • Studio Splash   │         │ • CarPhysics.hx   │        │ • UIManager.hx    │
  │ • Engine Splash   │         │ • Track.hx        │        │ • UIIcons.hx      │
  │ • Disclaimer/FOSS │         │ • TrafficSystem.hx│        │ • ControlDiagrams │
  │ • Async Preload   │         │ • ChaseCamera.hx  │        │ • AudioManager.hx │
  │ • Showcase Curtain│         │ • GraphicsManager │        │ • SaveSystem.hx   │
  └───────────────────┘         └───────────────────┘        └───────────────────┘
```

### Module Breakdown

| Module | Location | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|
| **Entry Point** | `src/Main.hx` | Boot state machine, canvas resize lifecycle, showcase rotation, and async asset loading. |
| **Physics** | `src/physics/CarPhysics.hx` | Velocity integration, lateral tire slip friction, chassis roll/pitch, and drift transitions. |
| **World** | `src/world/Track.hx` | Procedural multi-lane spline road generation, asphalt shaders, and ground lift constants. |
| **Traffic** | `src/entities/TrafficSystem.hx` | Autonomous obstacle spawning, waypoint trajectory math, and collision volumes. |
| **Vehicle Mesh** | `src/entities/CarMesh.hx` | Procedural 3D chassis geometry, materials, and steerable front wheel assemblies. |
| **Camera** | `src/core/ChaseCamera.hx` | Damped spring chase camera with dynamic FOV dilation and non-linear trauma shake decay. |
| **UI Management** | `src/core/UIManager.hx` | Menus, sliders, credits view, bumper tab navigation, and modal containment. |
| **Vector Icons** | `src/core/UIIcons.hx` | Procedural vector icon generation via `h2d.Graphics` cached to `h2d.Tile`. |
| **Input Handler** | `src/input/InputController.hx` | Edge-detection polling for Gamepad API and keyboard with remapping registers. |
| **Audio Synth** | `src/core/AudioManager.hx` | Web Audio tone synthesis for engine frequencies, tire friction, and UI beeps. |
| **Persistence** | `src/core/SaveSystem.hx` | Serialization of graphics settings, audio gains, and in-progress race saves. |

