## Project Structure

```text
├── CHANGELOG.md                   # Chronological version changelog
├── CONTRIBUTING                   # Project contribution and governance terms
├── LICENSE                        # Custom proprietary software license
├── README                         # This README document
├── SECURITY.md                    # Security vulnerability reporting policy
├── compile.hxml                   # Haxe compiler build configuration
├── changelogs/                    # Detailed milestone release records
│   └── 2026-10-06-v0.1.0-initial.md
├── res/                           # Embedded assets
│   └── fonts/
│       ├── stack_sans.ttf
│       └── symbols.ttf
├── src/
│   ├── Main.hx                    # Entry point & intro sequence controller
│   ├── core/                      # Architecture and boot packages
│   ├── entities/                  # Vehicle meshes and traffic simulation
│   ├── input/                     # Gamepad, keyboard, and touch controller
│   ├── physics/                   # Vehicle dynamics, raycast suspension, drift
│   ├── ui/                        # High-density HUD, options panels, and controls
│   └── world/                     # Highway circuit geometry & boundaries
├── tests/                         # Dual-tier automated testing infrastructure
│   ├── TestMain.hx                # Headless unit test runner (utest)
│   ├── node-runner.js             # Node.js DOM/storage shims for Heaps JS
│   ├── run-browser-tests.js       # Headless Edge CDP automation runner
│   ├── audio/                     # Audio manager test cases
│   ├── camera/                    # Chase camera FOV & trauma test cases
│   ├── core/                      # Version and core system test cases
│   ├── entities/                  # Traffic AI and vehicle mesh test cases
│   ├── input/                     # Sensitivity & input controller test cases
│   ├── physics/                   # Raycast suspension & drift test cases
│   ├── save/                      # Save schema migration & touch settings tests
│   ├── ui/                        # Graphics options & touch HUD test cases
│   └── world/                     # Track spline & waypoint test cases
├── compile.hxml                   # Production JS compilation configuration
├── test.hxml                      # Headless unit testing compilation configuration
└── web/                           # Production web root & PWA distribution bundle
    ├── index.html                 # App shell with noscript fallback & canvas
    ├── test-suite.html            # Interactive browser test suite & visual verification
    ├── manifest.json              # Web App Manifest (standalone landscape)
    ├── sw.js                      # Cache-first Service Worker
    ├── game.js                    # Compiled JavaScript bundle (generated)
    ├── icons/
    │   ├── icon-192.png            # High-DPI PWA icon (192x192)
    │   └── icon-512.png            # High-DPI PWA icon (512x512)
    └── intro/                     # Sequential splash branding
        ├── jagofr-rvl-splash.webp # Studio & developer splash graphic (1080p)
        ├── heaps-haxe-splash.webp # Heaps engine splash graphic (1080p)
        └── icons/                 # Screen 3 attribution badge logos
            ├── logo_haxe.webp
            ├── logo_heaps.webp
            └── logo_webgl.webp
```

